NewsAgent

As an admin I want to create news agent role to handle expension of personal
As an admin I want to read existing news agents to be able to keep track of them for security reasons
As an admin I want to update existing news agents to update any changes in information
As an admin I want to delete news agents in case anyone is fired or retired.

Delivery Area

As a news agent I want to create address and classify them in delivery areas to organise deliveries more effectively.
As a news agent I want to read addresses and delivery areas so I know where to send delivery persons
As a news agent I want to update delivery areas and orders so that the system remains accurate when customers are moved or new customers are added
As a news agent I want to delete delivery areas or addresses in case of cancelations of service
As a news agent I want to print delivery list in order, so that each delivery person knows which publications to deliver to each address

Acceptance Criteria

NewsAgent
Admin can enter required details to create news agent added to system where each news agent will have their own unique id including details such as username and contact，system should display alert if information entered being successful or invalid.
Admin can select existing news agent for their details displayed which include id, name, address and contact that all stored in the system, error alert will display if news agent does not exist.
Admin can edit and save details of existing news agent, updated details should be displayed when the news agent is selected again and invalid information or empty fields shoud display error alert.
Admin can delete selected news agent's account as they should no longer appear in the system, error message will display if news agent deleted does not exist.


Delivery Area
Admin can select and edit address' delivery area or order then save updated info.
Delivery list should be displayed according to their assigned delivery order.
Each address will assigned to id that linked to specific areas
